{
 "id": 589176307930,
 "title": "GRAVEL LUGGED FRAME BUILD BY PETER",
 "body_html": "<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"\" role=\"listitem\">\n  <div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"680938726\">\n    <div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n      <div class=\"prOLdf\">\n        <div class=\"g53bl\">\n          <h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.680938726 c299\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What made you decide to build a bamboo bike?</span></h4>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n      <div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">I have been a long time bike tinkereralnd amateur mechanic and this seemed like a great opportunity to truly build a bike from scratch.</div>\n      <div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" role=\"listitem\">\n  <div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"845063547\">\n    <div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n      <div class=\"prOLdf\">\n        <div class=\"g53bl\">\n          <h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.845063547\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">Did you enjoy building the bicycle from scratch and would you recommend the experience?</span></h4>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n      <div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Yes I would definitely recommend this process to anyone who enjoys working on their own bikes.</div>\n      <div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" role=\"listitem\">\n  <div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"805044919\">\n    <div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n      <div class=\"prOLdf\">\n        <div class=\"g53bl\">\n          <h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.805044919 c304\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What did you find most difficult about your bike build?</span></h4>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n      <div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">The trickiest part was the final gluing and lining up of the rear triangle. I did multiple dry runs to make sure I had the process down and that the back wheel was nice and straight.</div>\n      <div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" role=\"listitem\">\n  <div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"1370153519\">\n    <div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n      <div class=\"prOLdf\">\n        <div class=\"g53bl\">\n          <h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1370153519\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What was the easiest part of the build?</span></h4>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n      <div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">I would rate the overall process and nice and easy. the instructions and videos were great and a huge help as well.</div>\n      <div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" role=\"listitem\">\n  <div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"862135650\">\n    <div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n      <div class=\"prOLdf\">\n        <div class=\"g53bl\">\n          <h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.862135650 c309\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">How would you describe the ride of your finished bike?</span></h4>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n      <div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Still winter here in Chicago but my initial test rides around the neighborhood have been nice and smooth.</div>\n      <div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" role=\"listitem\">\n  <div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"1476906189\">\n    <div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n      <div class=\"prOLdf\">\n        <div class=\"g53bl\">\n          <h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1476906189 c312\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What would you improve about the build experience or your finished bike?</span></h4>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n      <div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">For future versions of the lugged kit I would recommend a bit more solid jigs for mounting the frame after glueing.</div>\n      <div class=\"halo-row\">\n        <div class=\"first-image\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/IMG_0098---Peter-Evans.jpg?v=1677757657\" alt=\"\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"first-image\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/IMG_0099---Peter-Evans.jpg?v=1677757676\" alt=\"\">\n      </div>\n        \n      </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <style>\n    .first-image{\n    width: 50%;\n    padding: 10px;\n    }\n  </style>",
